in Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/builders-developers-in-mumbai.htm \"Real Estate Builder & Developers in Mumbai\")\n  + [Vaastu Consultant in Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/vaastu-consultants-in-mumbai.htm \"Vaastu Shastra Consultant in Mumbai\")\n\n[Post Property **Free**](https://www.realestateindia.com/post-property-for-sale-rent.php \"Post Property\") \n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/help-icon.jpg)\n\n* [Help Center](https://www.realestateindia.com/help/)\n* [Sales Enquiry](https://www.realestateindia.com/contactus.htm)\n\n[9:30AM to 6:00PM IST +91-8929175327](tel:+91-8929175327)  Request A Call Back\n\nTo share your queries. [Click here!](https://www.realestateindia.com/feedback.htm)\n\nSign In  \n Join Free\n\n[Login](https://www.realestateindia.com/login.php \"Login\")\n\nNew to RealEstateIndia? [Sign Up](https://www.realestateindia.com/registration.php \"Sign Up\")\n\n* Profile\n* My Dashboard\n* My Enquiry\n* Post Property\n* My Property\n* [Property Leads New](https://www.realestateindia.com/property-lead \"Property Leads\")\n* Post Requirement\n* [Advertise with us](https://www.realestateindia.com/advertise/ \"Advertise with us\")\n* Search by Property ID\n* [Download App](https://www.realestateindia.com/download-mobile-apps.htm \"Download Mobile App\")\n\n* [Home](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/ \"Home\")\n* [Residential Projects in Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/residential-projects.htm \"Residential Projects in Mumbai\")\n* [Residential Projects in Borivali East Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/residential-projects-in-mumbai-borivali-east.htm \"Residential Projects in Borivali East, Mumbai\")\n* CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen in Borivali East Mumbai\n\n![CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen, Mumbai - CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh4/project28266/proj_header_image-28266.jpg)\n\n![CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen, Mumbai - CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh2/project28266/28266-359740.jpg)   ![CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen, Mumbai - CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh2/project28266/28266-359741.jpg)\n\n+   \n11 more\n\n# CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\nPrice 1.06 Cr. Onwards\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Flats / Apartments\n\nRERA :  P51800003067 \n\nRERA Details\n\n| Phase | Status | Number |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Phase 1 | Registered | P51800003067 View QR Code |\n\n[![Close](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/close_icon.svg)](javascript:void(0);) \n\n![]()\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details.\n\nRERA : https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/\n\n* [Overview](#pdOverview)\n* [Unit Configuration](#pdPriceRange)\n* [Specifications](#pdSpecification)\n* [Amenities](#pdAminities)\n* [Gallery](#projectGallery)\n* [More](javascript:void(0);) \n  + [About Builder](#pdAboutBuilderProject)\n\nCCI Rivali Park Wintergreen 1.06 Cr. (Onwards) Flats / Apartments\n\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img1.jpg)\n\n  Property Type  \n\n  Flats / Apartments\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img2.jpg)\n\n  Configuration  \n\n  1, 2, 3 BHK\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img13.jpg)\n\n  Area of Flats / Apartments  \n\n  449 - 1201 Sq.ft.\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img3.jpg)\n\n  Pricing  \n\n  1.06 - 2.82 Cr.\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img4.jpg)\n\n  Possession  \n\n  Dec 2019\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img5.jpg)\n\n  Total Units  \n\n  708 units\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img7.jpg)\n\n  Total Area  \n\n  1.96 Acres\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img8.jpg)\n\n  Launch Date  \n\n  Jan 2012\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img9.jpg)\n\n  Possession Status  \n\n  Ongoing Projects\n\n## Unit Configuration\n\n| Unit Type | Area | Price (in ) | Floor Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK+1T | 449 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 1.06 Cr. |  |\n| 1 BHK+1T | 585 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 1.37 Cr. |  |\n| 2 BHK+2T | 898 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 2.11 Cr. |  |\n| 2 BHK+2T | 918 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 2.16 Cr. |  |\n| 2 BHK+2T | 935 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 2.20 Cr. |  |\n| 3 BHK+3T | 1183 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 2.78 Cr. |  |\n| 3 BHK+3T | 1201 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | 2.82 Cr. |  |\n\n[View More](javascript:void(0);) [View Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n## About CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\nA sprawling ready to use clubhouse, walking distance to Sanjay Gandhi National Park. These are just some of the luxuries that residents of Rivali Park’s Wintergreen will enjoy upon possession. Winte [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\nAbout CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\nA sprawling ready to use clubhouse, walking distance to Sanjay Gandhi National Park. These are just some of the luxuries that residents of Rivali Park’s Wintergreen will enjoy upon possession.\n\nWintergreen residents can revel in multiple activities within the Clubhouse. A well-equipped gym, yoga deck, squash court, a mini-theatre, an indoor games room, a jogging track, a children’s play area, a multi-purpose court etc. If that’s not impressive enough then here’s how Wintergreen is a sustainable project: Besides being certified by the IGBC, Rivali Park has also ensured that the building is sustainable and its residents can enjoy large open spaces.\n\n## Specifications\n\n* Walls\n\n  + Exterior Emulsion Paint\n  + Kitchen Ceramic Tiles Dado\n  + Toilets Ceramic Tiles Dado up to 7 Feet Height Above Platform\n  + Interior Emulsion Paint\n* Others\n\n  + Windows Anodized Aluminium Sliding\n  + Wiring Concealed copper wiring\n  + Frame Structure Anti Termite Treatment\n* Flooring\n\n  + Master Bedroom Wooden Flooring\n  + Toilets Anti Skid Tiles\n  + Living/Dining Vitrified tiles\n  + Balcony Anti Skid Tiles\n  + Kitchen Anti Skid Tiles\n  + Other Bedroom Vitrified tiles\n* Fittings\n\n  + Kitchen Granite platform with stainless steel sink\n  + Toilets Branded CP Fittings and Sanitary Ware\n* Doors\n\n  + Internal Flush Shutters\n\n## Amenities\n\n* ![Gymnasium](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/gymnasium.jpg)\n\n  Gymnasium\n* ![Intercom](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/intercom.jpg)\n\n  Intercom\n* ![Indoor Games](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/indoor-games.jpg)\n\n  Indoor Games\n* ![Jogging and Strolling Tracks](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/jogging-strolling-tracks.jpg)\n\n  Jogging and Strolling Tracks\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/kids-play-area.jpg)\n\n  Kids Play Area\n* ![Lift](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/lift.jpg)\n\n  Lift\n\n[Show All](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Gymnasium](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/gymnasium.jpg)\n\n  Gymnasium\n* ![Intercom](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/intercom.jpg)\n\n  Intercom\n* ![Indoor Games](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/indoor-games.jpg)\n\n  Indoor Games\n* ![Jogging and Strolling Tracks](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/jogging-strolling-tracks.jpg)\n\n  Jogging and Strolling Tracks\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/kids-play-area.jpg)\n\n  Kids Play Area\n* ![Lift](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/lift.jpg)\n\n  Lift\n* ![Multi-Purpose Hall](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/multi-purpose-hall.jpg)\n\n  Multi-Purpose Hall\n* ![Power Backup](https://static.realestateindia.c