al, Commercial, Retail, Hospitality and Cultural Centres Within a Gated Community, Setting a New Standard for Convenient Living. Situated in Breathtakingly Beautifully Landscaped Grounds, this Architecturally Timeless and Future-proof Development Reflects the Aspirations and Desires of the Community It Serves.\n\nRivali Park, CCI Compound, Western Express Highway,, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Other Projects of this Builder\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project28268/proj_header_image-28268-350x350.jpg)\n\nCCI Whitespring\n\n[CCI Whitespring](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/cci-whitespring-by-rivali-park-in-borivali-east-mumbai/)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2.32 Cr.-3.76 Cr.\n\n758-1087 /Sq.ft.\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n## Frequently asked questions\n\n1. Where is Rivali Park Located?\n\n   Rivali Park is located in Borivali East, Mumbai.\n2. What type of property can I find in Rivali Park?\n\n   You can easily find 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments in Rivali Park.\n3. What is the size of 1 BHK apartment in Rivali Park?\n\n   The approximate size of a 1 BHK apartment here are 449 Sq.ft., 585 Sq.ft.\n4. What is the size of 2 BHK apartment in Rivali Park?\n\n   The approximate size of a 2 BHK apartment here are 898 Sq.ft., 918 Sq.ft., 935 Sq.ft.\n5. What is the size of 3 BHK apartment in Rivali Park?\n\n   The approximate size of a 3 BHK apartment here are 1183 Sq.ft., 1201 Sq.ft.\n6. What is the starting price of an apartment in Rivali Park?\n\n   You can find an apartment in Rivali Park at a starting price of 1.06 Cr..\n7. By when can I gain possession of property in Rivali Park?\n\n   You can get complete possession of your property here by Dec 2019.\n\n## CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen Get Best Offer on this Project\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![Ekta Meadows](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh6/project2/morya-2.jpg \"Ekta Meadows\")\n\n[Ekta Meadows](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/ekta-meadows-by-ekta-s