om/mumbai/borivali-east/plots-lpt6l1433)\n/* CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\n## CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: CCI Projects](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-cci-projects-d6955)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Final Plot No. 163 A1 And 163 A2 And 165 At Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.31 Cr to 3.51 Cr\\*\n\n![CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/47888/1577105253_cci_elevaiton1.jpeg \"CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\")\n\n# CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/47888/1577105253_cci_elevaiton1.jpeg \"CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 935 sqft - 1183 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 708 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 1.96 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2019\n* Rera: P51800003067\n\n## About\n\nFor those home seekers who want a perfect home developed by a known developer in the main areas of city, it is not easy to find such an abode unless they go for the project **CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen** where their requirements can be fulfilled. This is a residential home project developed by CCI projects Pvt Ltd which is a known brand in the market. The homes here are available in the size of 1BHK, 2BHK and 3BHK with the area that ranges from 449 sq ft to 1201 sq ft. Here one can find the project developed on a vast land area which is 1.96 acres. In this project there are total 708 units with modern design and elegance. The homes here are also perfect in terms of wind direction and natural light. There is hardly any facility which is not available in the proximity of this project.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![Fire Alarm](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804761_fire-alarm.svg) Fire Alarm\n\n## Floor Plans of CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\n![CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/47888/1577105209_cci_1bhk1.jpeg \"CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen Floor Plan 449 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (449 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/47888/1577105209_cci_1bhk2.jpeg \"CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen Floor Plan 585 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (585 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 1.05 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-cci-rivali-park-wintergreen-borivali-east-mumbai-prop47888)\n\n## Bank Offers for CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958767_axis.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958761_canara.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958377_indiabulls.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958423_pnb.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958411_tata.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528957944_reliance_capital.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528956975_dhfl.png \" \")\n\n![imageBackh](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/imageBackh.png)\n\n## Hi! I'm here to answer all your queries.\n\n**Vaishali Vasant Tiwari**  \n Relationship Manager\n\n[Chat with us](https://wa.me/8800117588?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen)\n\n## CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen Specifications\n\n![Electrical & Power Backup](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/power_back_up-grey.svg)\n\nElectrical & Power Backup\n\nCopper wiring in concealed PVC conduits Sufficient light and power points.\n\n![Kitchen](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/kitchen.svg)\n\nKitchen\n\nKitchen will be designed to suit modular kitchen Panic button connected to security on the ground floor.\n\n![Structure](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor-plans2.svg)\n\nStructure\n\nSeismic Zone 2 compliant structure and Solid Block Masonry.\n\n![Planning](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor-plans2.svg)\n\nPlanning\n\nPlots in the well planned urban estate with the provision of quality infrastructure and public utility services.\n\n![Flooring](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor.svg)\n\nFlooring\n\nVitrified tiles in drawing/dining/bedrooms and kitchen.\n\n![Security](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/security_personnel-grey.svg)\n\nSecurity\n\nSecurity guard at Project main entrance. CCTV Surveillance.\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali East, Mumbai\n\nLocation\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\nLivibility score\n\nBorivali east is one of the leading areas from east and west parts of the Borivali area. The harbor railway separates them. One can see massive development in this area as far as real estate projects are concerned. For this area the biggest positive is its connectivity to the areas of the city as well as other parts of the state as it is on the Western Highway. The area has some of th... [Read More](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/guide)\n\n## Explore Neighbourhoods of cci rivali park wintergreen, Borivali East\n\n##\n\n##\n\n##\n\n## Properties Price Trend in the Borivali East\n\n## Similar Properties to CCI Rivali Park Wintergreen in Borivali East\n\nReady to Move\n\n![Triveni Neel Aakash](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/39168/Triveni_Neel_Aakash_elevation_1.jpg)\n\n##### [Triveni Neel Aakash](https://www.addressofchoice.com/triveni-neel-aakash-borivali-east-mumbai-p39168)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg) Borivali East, Mumbai\n\nPrice\n\n#### ₹ 1.71 Cr\n\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg \"Kids Play Area\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg \"Swimming Pool\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg \"Lifts\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg \"Car Parking\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg \"Water Storage\")\n* ![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886685_waste_disposal.svg \"Waste Disposal\")\n\nReady to Move\n\n![Shree Ganesh Imperial Heights Apartments](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/39199/Shree_Ganesh_Imperial_Heights_Apartments_el