ress Highway, Magathane Metro Station, & the Borivali Railway Station. There are plenty of business centers, healthcare facilities, educational institutions and shopping complexes in the vicinity to ensure a comfortable living:\n\n**Healthcare Facilities**\n\n* Surbhi Life Care Hospital\n* Lifeline Medicare Hospital\n\n**Educational Institutions**\n\n* Cambridge School\n* Oxford International School\n* JCBN International School\n\n**Shopping Complexes**\n\n* Thakur Mall\n* Growel€™s 101 Mall\n* Raghuleela Mall\n\n**Shopping Complexes:**\n\n* Agora Business Plaza\n* Mahindra & Mahindra\n* Wadhwa Technopark\n\n**Day Outing**\n\n* Sanjay Gandhi National Park\n\nIt is known for being a prime location for residences as numerous residential complexes are housed there along with many posh and upmarket multi-story buildings. Job opportunities in Borivali are plenty as many companies have their offices in this prominent Mumbai suburb. Whether you want luxury homes or budget apartments, this locality has it all! Moreover, Borivali is excellent when it comes to public commuting thanks to the Western Express Highway, Borivali Railway Station and the Mumbai Rapid Metro opening multiple stations in this area. This is expected to drive property rates upward considerably in the coming years.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/636b5f0b831fdd6844dbdbe2/9b49132f-f151-4af3-8863-ca155769a032_18-1.jpg)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* Similar Properties\n* Nearby Properties\n* More properties by CCI\n\n[![CCI Rivali Park Sunburst-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/658a8dfc3fbc0da68da0b0ea/8215b488-3e28-44d0-92ec-045871e77460_Screenshot2023-12-26140401.png)\n\n#### CCI Rivali Park Sunburst\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2 & 3 BHK Flats\n\n1.6 Cr-2.3 Cr](/properties/details/cci/borivali-east/cci-rivali-park-sunburst/658a8dfc3fbc0da68da0b0ea)\n\n[![Godrej Bliss-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/c